# MF-05: compiled test binaries and session evidence must not be committed.
# These patterns do not untrack files already in git; removing the
# already-committed copies (test binaries, .nettrace/.wer traces, result CSVs,
# evidence bundles) needs a history rewrite, which is a separate decision.
# Evidence produced after this change belongs in the evidence store / LFS,
# not in this repository.
code/*_tests
code/*_tests_san
artifacts/
*.nettrace
*.wer
m0/results_*/
m3/results_*/
z4/results_*/
